			"notes": "**Feature update!**\n\n- Improved the looks of the structure icons\n- Replaced the structure icons of Abandoned Camp and Mineshaft\n- Added a right click menu to structures: You can now mark a structure as completed, copy its coordinates, create a waypoint and see how far it is from you.\n- Added biome highlights in the Seed Atlas settings: Choose the biome you want highlighted and turn highlighting on. You will now see it more clearly on the map.\n\nThis version is compatible with 1.46.4 of Xaero's World Map."
		},
